        <guid>https://producthunt.programnotes.cn/en/p/langwatch/</guid>
        <description>&lt;img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1683699947127-7fea7bf89d73?ixid=M3w0NjAwMjJ8MHwxfHJhbmRvbXx8fHx8fHx8fDE3NDYyNTcxMjF8&amp;ixlib=rb-4.0.3" alt="Featured image of post langwatch" /&gt;&lt;h1 id=&#34;langwatchlangwatch&#34;&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/langwatch/langwatch&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;langwatch/langwatch&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://producthunt.programnotes.cn/assets/logo-header.webp&#34;
	
	
	
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;logo.webp&#34;
	
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&#34;center&#34;&gt;
&lt;a href=&#34;https://discord.gg/kT4PhDS2gH&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://img.shields.io/badge/LangWatch-Discord-%235865F2.svg&#34; alt=&#34;Discord&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href=&#34;https://pypi.org/project/langwatch/&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://img.shields.io/pypi/v/langwatch?color=007EC6&#34; alt=&#34;LangWatch Python SDK version&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.npmjs.com/package/langwatch&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://img.shields.io/npm/v/langwatch?color=007EC6&#34; alt=&#34;LangWatch TypeScript SDK version&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;LangWatch is an open platform for &lt;strong&gt;Observing&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Evaluating&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Optimizing&lt;/strong&gt; your LLM and Agentic applications. We offer:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.langwatch.ai/integration/overview&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;&lt;strong&gt;Observability&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; - Add tracing to your LLM, based on the OpenTelemetry standard, allowing LangWatch to provide real-time powers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.langwatch.ai/llm-evaluation/offline-evaluation&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;&lt;strong&gt;Evaluation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; - Run real-time and offline evaluations against production or synthetic datasets. Compare performance across various matrixes (prompts, modules, hosting providers, and complete LLM pipelines).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.langwatch.ai/features/datasets&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;&lt;strong&gt;Datasets&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; - Automatically created from traced messages, or upload, datasets which can be used across the platform for evals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.langwatch.ai/optimization-studio/overview&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;&lt;strong&gt;Optimization Studio&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; – Build and run evaluations faster with our no+lo 🧘 code studio. If you need more flexibility, you have access to the DSL that powers it too.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prompt Management &amp;amp; Optimization&lt;/strong&gt; – Version prompts, test changes on datasets, and improve real-world performance. Auto-optimize with DSPy&amp;rsquo;s MIPROv2 to generate better prompts and few-shot examples.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.langwatch.ai/features/annotations&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;&lt;strong&gt;Annotations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; - Human in the Loop, done right. Accelerate better data creation by combining domain expert input with smart workflows. Use LangWatch&amp;rsquo;s intuitive annotation interface to collaborate directly with experts while keeping full control over your code. Quickly generate high-quality labels, catch edge cases, and fine-tune datasets to build more accurate, robust AI models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;LangWatch is framework- and LLM-agnostic, with support for (LangGraph, DSPy, Langflow, Flowise, and others) and LLM providers (OpenAI, Azure, Bedrock, Gemini, Deepseek, Groq, MistralAI, VertexAI, LiteLLM, and others) via &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://opentelemetry.io/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;OpenTelemetry&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our use of &lt;strong&gt;open&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;community-driven&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;standards&lt;/strong&gt; is all about supporting your business decisions, and enabling your teams to be flexible to the rapidly changing AI ecosystem without worrying about compatibility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;-deploying-langwatch&#34;&gt;🚢 Deploying LangWatch
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id=&#34;local-setup-&#34;&gt;Local setup 💻
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Get up and running in under 30 seconds. The example below uses Docker, but if you prefer helm charts check out the instructions here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;3
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;4
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;git clone https://github.com/langwatch/langwatch.git
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;cp langwatch/.env.example langwatch/.env
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;docker compose up -d --wait --build
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;open http://localhost:5560
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;You&amp;rsquo;ll be launched right into our onboarding flow. Welcome aboard 🫡.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;cloud-&#34;&gt;Cloud ☁️
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;The easiest way to get started with LangWatch is via our Cloud offering. &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://app.langwatch.ai&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Create a free account&lt;/a&gt; to get started.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;other-flavours-&#34;&gt;Other Flavours 🍦
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;details&gt;
&lt;summary&gt;Self-hosted (OnPrem) ⚓️&lt;/summary&gt;
LangWatch offers a fully self-hosted version of the platform for companies that require strict data control and compliance, complete with Azure AD support.
&lt;p&gt;Read more about it on our &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.langwatch.ai/self-hosting/overview&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;docs&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/details&gt;
&lt;details&gt;
&lt;summary&gt;Hybrid (OnPrem data) 🔀&lt;/summary&gt;
LangWatch offers a hybrid setup for companies that have strict data control and compliance requirements, without needing to go fully on-prem.
&lt;p&gt;Read more about it on our &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.langwatch.ai/hybrid-setup/overview&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;docs&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/details&gt;
&lt;details&gt;
&lt;summary&gt;Local Development 👩‍💻&lt;/summary&gt;
You can also run LangWatch locally without docker to develop and help contribute to the project.
&lt;p&gt;Start just the databases using docker and leave it running:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;docker compose up redis postgres opensearch
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Then, on another terminal, install the dependencies and start LangWatch:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;make install
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;make start
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/details&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;-quick-start&#34;&gt;🚀 Quick Start
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Get observing in minutes. Now you have an account and have created a project inside LangWatch, lets get your messages flowing through LangWatch.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;[!NOTE]&lt;br&gt;
Not using Python or OpenAI? Don&amp;rsquo;t worry, we have your back . &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.langwatch.ai/integration/overview&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Visit our docs&lt;/a&gt; for full guides for other popular languages, LLM providers, and frameworks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;install-and-configure-sdk&#34;&gt;Install and configure SDK
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Available for install via &lt;code&gt;pip&lt;/code&gt;, or &lt;code&gt;uv&lt;/code&gt;. The SDK will also check your environment variables by default for your API key and endpoint.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;pip install langwatch
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;3
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;4
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-python&#34; data-lang=&#34;python&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;LANGWATCH_API_KEY&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;s2&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;sk-lw-...&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;c1&#34;&gt;# This is only needed if you aren&amp;#39;t using LangWatch Cloud.&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;c1&#34;&gt;# LANGWATCH_ENDPOINT=&amp;#34;https://self-hosted-url.internal/&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id=&#34;create-your-first-trace-and-auto-instrument-openai&#34;&gt;Create your first trace and auto-instrument OpenAI
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;
&lt;table class=&#34;lntable&#34;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;3
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;4
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;5
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;6
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;7
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;8
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;lnt&#34;&gt;9
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&#34;lntd&#34;&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-python&#34; data-lang=&#34;python&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;kn&#34;&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;nn&#34;&gt;langwatch&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;kn&#34;&gt;from&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;nn&#34;&gt;openai&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;kn&#34;&gt;import&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;OpenAI&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;client&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;OpenAI&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nd&#34;&gt;@langwatch.trace&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;k&#34;&gt;def&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;nf&#34;&gt;main&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;():&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;    &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;langwatch&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;get_current_trace&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;autotrack_openai_calls&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;client&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;    &lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;...&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id=&#34;see-your-traces-in-langwatch&#34;&gt;See your traces in LangWatch
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://producthunt.programnotes.cn/assets/trace-view.webp&#34;
	
	
	
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;A view of a trace in the LangWatch app&#34;
	
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You can also view a public share of the trace &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://app.langwatch.ai/share/pA8sBaRf5Nn2sa7OkhJfi&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;&lt;strong&gt;here&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;-integrations&#34;&gt;🗺️ Integrations
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;LangWatch builds and maintains several integrations listed below, additionally our tracing platform is built on top of &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://opentelemetry.io/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;OpenTelemetry&lt;/a&gt;, so we support any OpenTelemetry compatible library out of the box.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We also support various community standards, such as &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/Arize-ai/openinference&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;OpenInference&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/traceloop/openllmetry&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;OpenLLMetry&lt;/a&gt;, and more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;python-&#34;&gt;Python 🐍
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our Python SDK supports the following auto-instrumentors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.langwatch.ai/integration/python/guide#open-ai&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;OpenAI&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.langwatch.ai/integration/python/guide#azure&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Azure&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.langwatch.ai/integration/python/guide#lite-llm&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;LiteLLM&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.langwatch.ai/integration/python/guide#ds-py&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;DSPy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.langwatch.ai/integration/python/guide#lang-chain&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;LangChain&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Though OpenTelemetry, we also support all the frameworks and providers that support them, such as:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AWS Bedrock&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Haystack&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CrewAI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Autogen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grok&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;…and many more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You can find a &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.langwatch.ai/integration/opentelemetry/guide&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;full guide&lt;/a&gt; on our docs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;javascript-&#34;&gt;JavaScript ☕️
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our JavaScript SDK supports the following instrumentors:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.langwatch.ai/integration/typescript/guide#vercel-ai-sdk&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Vercel AI SDK&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.langwatch.ai/integration/typescript/guide#open-ai&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;OpenAI&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.langwatch.ai/integration/typescript/guide#azure&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Azure&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.langwatch.ai/integration/typescript/guide#lang-chain-js&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;LangChain.js&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;platforms&#34;&gt;Platforms
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.langwatch.ai/integration/langflow&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;LangFlow&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.langwatch.ai/integration/flowise&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Flowise&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you using a platform that could benefit from a direct LangWatch integration? We&amp;rsquo;d love to hear from you, please &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.notion.so/1e35e165d48280468247fcbdc3349077?pvs=21&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;&lt;strong&gt;fill out this very quick form.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;-community&#34;&gt;🥰 Community
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Join our &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://discord.gg/kT4PhDS2gH&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Discord&lt;/a&gt; community&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Follow our &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://x.com/LangWatchAI&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Twitter&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;-support&#34;&gt;💬 Support
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Have questions or need help? We&amp;rsquo;re here to support you in multiple ways:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Documentation:&lt;/strong&gt; Our comprehensive &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.langwatch.ai&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;documentation&lt;/a&gt; covers everything from getting started to advanced features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Discord Community:&lt;/strong&gt; Join our &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://discord.gg/kT4PhDS2gH&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Discord server&lt;/a&gt; for real-time help from our team and community.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;GitHub Issues:&lt;/strong&gt; Report bugs or request features through our &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/langwatch/langwatch&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;GitHub repository&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Support:&lt;/strong&gt; Enterprise customers receive priority support with dedicated response times. Our &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://langwatch.ai/pricing&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;pricing page&lt;/a&gt; contains more information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;-collaborating&#34;&gt;🤝 Collaborating
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Contributions are what make the open-source community such an amazing place to learn, inspire, and create. Any contributions you make are &lt;strong&gt;greatly appreciated&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please read our &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/langwatch/langwatch/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Contribution Guidelines&lt;/a&gt; for details on our code of conduct, and the process for submitting pull requests.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;-license&#34;&gt;✍️ License
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Please read our &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;http://LICENSE.md&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;LICENSE.md&lt;/a&gt; file.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;-security--compliance&#34;&gt;👮‍♀️ Security + Compliance
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;As a platform that has access to data that is highly likely to be be sensitive, we take security incredibly seriously and treat it as a core part of our culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
	&lt;thead&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;th&gt;Legal Framework&lt;/th&gt;
					&lt;th&gt;Current Status&lt;/th&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
	&lt;/thead&gt;
	&lt;tbody&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;GDPR&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Compliant. DPA available upon request.&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;ISO 27001&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Certified. Certification report available upon request on our Enterprise plan.&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
	&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please refer to our Security page for more information. Contact us at &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;mailto:security@langwatch.ai&#34; &gt;security@langwatch.ai&lt;/a&gt; if you have any further questions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;vulnerability-disclosure&#34;&gt;Vulnerability Disclosure
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you need to do a responsible disclosure of a security vulnerability, you may do so by email to &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;mailto:security@langwatch.ai&#34; &gt;security@langwatch.ai&lt;/a&gt;, or if you prefer you can reach out to one of our team privately on &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://discord.com/invite/kT4PhDS2gH&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Discord&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
